# Fixtures on which vera-next does not yet do what vera does under --check
# (`zig build diff-digital-device`, tests/differential/comp.zig with v_options): every
# .v fixture's harness command line with `--run` swapped for the flag. One
# line each: the fixture path under tests/conformance/tests, its owner, then
# the first difference. Each line is its owner's debt; a line whose fixture
# also differs under `--run` is comp.xfail's too. "digital_exe (build
# remarks)": the old native codegen's `note:` lines about how it built; the
# interpreted executable has none (a behaviour change the lead decides on).
# A listed fixture that agrees fails the run until its line goes. Refresh:
# -Dcomp-rebaseline writes zig-out/digital_device.xfail.new.
